// Relay: answers every Ping with a Pong after a fixed delay, counting the pings.
// Shows the zero-or-small-time reply idiom, a typed port, a variable and an output event.
accepts input on Ping with type String!
generates output on Pong with type String!

use delay with type double and default "0.5"!
use pings with type int and default "0"!
use lastPing with type String!

to start passivate in idle!
when in idle and receive Ping go to reply!

hold in reply for time "delay"!
after reply output Pong!
from reply go to idle!
when in reply and receive Ping go to reply eventually!

external event for idle with Ping
<%
    pings++;
    lastPing = (String) messageList.get(0).getData();
%>!
external event for reply with Ping
<%
    pings++;
    lastPing = (String) messageList.get(0).getData();
%>!
output event for reply
<%
    output.add(outPong, "pong " + pings + " for " + lastPing);
%>!
